                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ee718a2b-f573-3455-8bde-9019717953ea",
                        "entry_id": "9493af89-c127-378e-acea-2a39c36715ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to writing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "08a5a814-1be9-402a-abdd-17df37d318da",
                                "sense_id": "ee718a2b-f573-3455-8bde-9019717953ea",
                                "text": "Ruling this confined estate as if it were an escritorial fiefdom must be a drag. Or so I would imagine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83b89325-7c85-48bb-a4cd-300e12510fb8",
                                "sense_id": "ee718a2b-f573-3455-8bde-9019717953ea",
                                "text": "Despite his patronage of the escritorial arts, he was not a reader, so he tried storytellers and soon became bored."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92e0516d-d977-4dc8-9ca8-e66eaa0477f2",
                                "sense_id": "ee718a2b-f573-3455-8bde-9019717953ea",
                                "text": "The escritorial component is a writing of attenuated comfort, atomistic consciousness echoing one form of holocaust or the other."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85081402-6d45-486c-8788-d3f1bf2a64c2",
                                "sense_id": "ee718a2b-f573-3455-8bde-9019717953ea",
                                "text": "The clichés and the tropisms seem to play the roles of the escritorial Scylla and Charybdis . The writing vacillates constantly between one and the other, without being able to settle down anywhere."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77553754-c35c-4990-beed-b1cdbd85f699",
                                "sense_id": "ee718a2b-f573-3455-8bde-9019717953ea",
                                "text": "In addition to food and clothing I was carrying another bag full of treats for the locals, and writing materials necessary for my escritorial duties."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
